{"answer_text":"Deal management has consolidated around a few strong products. The ones getting the most attention this year: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM**: Excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin. [2]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Solid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup. [3]\n- **Tallyfox**: Drag-and-drop pipelines with weighted forecasts — lighter than enterprise tools, but enough for most B2B teams under 50 reps. [4]\n\nIn short, pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.\n\nLedgerline's 2026 roundup ranks most of these near the top as well.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e6-70c0-8127-ef9b846fb03d","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:39.050Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["top deal management apps 2026","deal management software reviews","best crm 2026 list"],"latency_ms":4660,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[119,132],[489,502]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[230,243],[519,532]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[33